  "body": "Stock page of #1440: it now follows the WCS page's layout (pattern list: https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/issues/1440#issuecomment-6859492011).\n\nWhat changed\n- Named groups through the shared `layout::group` / `prop_grid`: Shape (units, box/cylinder/from model, the models' size), Size, Position and rotation, Fit to models.\n- Labels left, fields in one column (was caption-over-control).\n- Apply / Fit to Models / Delete as one row of equal buttons (`wcs_page::even_row`), under the groups.\n- The size, source and per-side rows still show only for the chosen shape / \"Per side\".\n- Moved from `pages.rs` into `stock_page.rs` (pages.rs is far past the 400-line law). Layout only: same commands (`SetStock`, `StockFit`, `StockFitSides`, `DeleteByName`, `SetRawStockOnly`), same labels, no project-file change.\n\nScreenshots: before/after attached below\n\n| Before | After |\n|---|---|\n| (drag before.png here) | (drag after.png here) |\n\nTested\n- New structural test `the_stock_page_is_laid_out_in_groups_like_the_wcs_page` (stock_size.rs): group order, fields inside their groups, one label column, actions last and equal width.\n- Existing `stock_fit_sides`, `theme_door`, `stock_size`, `raw_stock_row` tests pass; ui lib single-threaded 675 passed; `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` green; clippy ui + app `-D warnings` clean.\n- No snapshot PNG touched. Not exercised: hand-test in the live window (headless render only).\n\nOpen PRs checked: #773, #1209, #1124 edit `pages.rs`/`setup_pages.rs` but not the Stock page body, so this branches from main; a merge-of-main may be needed for `pages.rs` hunks.\n\nChangelog: Stock page laid out in groups like the WCS page (#1440, PR #1460)\nEffort: medium\n\nRefs #1440\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX\n",
